L1: Effects of training adaption in endurance athletes with atrial fibrillation: protocol for a multicentre randomised controlled trial
L2: BMJ Open Sport — Exercise Medicine (2023)
L3: Turid Apelland, Kristel Janssens, Jan Pål Loennechen, Guido Claessen, Eivind Sørensen, Amy Mitchell, Andreas Berg Sellevold, Steve Enger, Sophia Onarheim, Jon Magne Letnes, Hielko Miljoen, Arnljot Tveit, André La Gerche, Marius Myrstad
