L750: **The Norwegian Exercise and Atrial Fibrillation Initiative**
L751: This work was executed within the framework of the research consortium the Norwegian Exercise
L752: and Atrial Fibrillation Initiative (NEXAF), which is a national research initiative aiming to increase
L753: knowledge about exercise in individuals with atrial fibrillation. NEXAF consists of several studies that
L754: will examine the impact of exercise on various endpoints for different groups of atrial fibrillation
L755: patients.
L756: **The NEXAF consortium**
